{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Aj5nYRSole1794888109.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國多家大型金融機構的網上服務出現技術故障。事故源於大通銀行一個系統的軟件問題，引發金融系統連鎖反應。</p><p></p><p>根據一個故障追蹤網站資料，大通銀行、美國銀行和富國銀行等，周一有客戶報稱網上服務中斷，或在存取帳戶遇到困難。截至當地下午2時，大通銀行接獲近4,800宗問題報告，是各間銀行中最多。</p><p></p><p>大通銀行承認出現技術問題，部分交易處理時間較平常長，客戶仍可存取帳戶和資金，但表明並非遭受網絡攻擊。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:19:31.355918+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T00:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:06:11.354112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:54.913282+00:00","content_hash":"2b8372c79379df8f0d468ffe8dc54b979e0fc7423b0e049a4c0473bbc4685b4d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:19:31.355918+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}